Xbox 360: the GX core timed by parts with timebase timers (pipe parsing, display-list checks, cached lists, recording; BP/CP/XF writes and vertex loading with SMS_XE_CORE_PARTS=1), less the renderer's time inside each, instead of port patch 11's QPC clock (two kernel calls a pipe command). Applied by xenon/tools/xstage to the staged copy only.
